to win your association football match using dribbling, shooting, skill moves and other mechanics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skill-based gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no luck or randomness factor involved in <strong>Strikers Club</strong>. The better team will win by having better team-play and individual skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952920/extras/c9312c04638b9b0dad9b78214ee60e99.poster.avif?t=1786706539\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952920/extras/c9312c04638b9b0dad9b78214ee60e99.webm?t=1786706539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952920/extras/c9312c04638b9b0dad9b78214ee60e99.mp4?t=1786706539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Real football</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strikers Club</strong> implements all of the game rules. Throw-ins, corners, penalties, fouls, and numerous other elements that make the game loyal to the sport.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose your position</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's name may be <strong>Strikers Club</strong>, but every position is represented in the game. Choose which one you prefer playing at the start of the match. If you play as a goalie, you have an extra set of mechanics to make the difference. You can even run up to participate in plays up the field!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SEE YOU ON THE FIELD!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952920/extras/4a6f1f58172794c28117b0c3dcf36df8.poster.avif?t=1786706539\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam